  m_text: "\u2022 <b>Left:</b> Short video task \u2014 look to play, speak aloud.\r\n\u2022
    <b>Right:</b> Tongue-twister challenge \u2014 10 rounds, tougher each step.\r\n\u2022
    <b>Goal:</b> Experience discreet, in-the-moment guidance (e.g., \u201CTry a slow
    breath\u2026\u201D).\r\n\u2022 <b>Privacy:</b> Audio isn\u2019t stored; we compute
    features (MFCC) locally.\r\n"
